s/17b696e766f345273ddfdda22c8a06f6.png","desc":"Receiving or discharging Bolt Charge partially loads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."},{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Supercharged Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b17b5725c96e59f838ae045b8433f8df.png","desc":"While amplified, ammo is gradually transferred from reserves to the magazine. \n\nWhile in Speed Booster, ammo regenerates faster and overflows the magazine."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"Recycled Energy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c42c7a489769ae6f2d7f84be17c5732b.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating targets grants energy to your lowest charged ability."},{"name":"Perfect Float","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4b84679efdbd9bf21d23c5e8e6516e5f.png","desc":"Being in combat for a moderate time increases airborne effectiveness and reduces flinch until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Eddy Current","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e0f3c00a8b2cbccb8f1f1b318026aeee.png","desc":"Temporarily increases reload speed and handling after sprinting or while amplified. This effect is improved when you are amplified."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Rolling Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/086174f30d9fbf5e68f473dac9eda710.png","desc":"Final blows grant Bolt Charge.\nWhile amplified, final blows grant additional Bolt Charge."},{"name":"Butterfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eb3ba71043446a256c3f6405b868eb08.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period without firing causes your target to explode the next time you deal final blows. Timer resets when you stop aiming down sights."},{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."},{"name":"Chain Reaction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d17a60978288581d13a4aab6b9fc2b0e.png","desc":"Each final blow with this weapon creates an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."},{"name":"Detonator Beam","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d29eb0cfbd44fd360cf3d5f2341bd7ea.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an explosion around the target."},{"name":"Killing Tally","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a64f5d3e972ea35b1789f62999235083.png","desc":"Kills increase this weapon's damage until it is stowed or reloaded."},{"name":"Closing Time","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a31da21e65dd889eb96b7e0b135bbbe.png","desc":"Improves range, accuracy, and handling as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Classy Contender","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ea99a5550787bc2196c717e98baff076.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant class ability energy."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[2,11,20,34],[2,11,20,35],[2,11,20,36],[2,15,20,34],[2,15,20,35],[2,15,20,36],[2,16,20,34],[2,16,20,35],[2,16,20,36],[4,11,20,34],[4,11,20,35],[4,11,20,36],[4,15,20,34],[4,15,20,35],[4,15,20,36],[4,16,20,34],[4,16,20,35],[4,16,20,36],[2,11,20,30],[2,15,20,30],[2,16,20,30],[4,11,20,30],[4,15,20,30],[4,16,20,30],[8,11,20,34],[8,11,20,35],[8,11,20,36],[8,15,20,34],[8,15,20,35],[8,15,20,36],[8,16,20,34],[8,16,20,35],[8,16,20,36],[2,11,17,30],[2,11,17,31],[2,11,17,32],[2,11,17,34],[2,11,17,35],[2,11,17,36],[2,11,18,30],[2,11,18,31],[2,11,18,32],[2,11,18,34],[2,11,18,35],[2,11,18,36],[2,11,20,31],[2,11,20,32],[2,11,21,30],[2,11,21,31],[2,11,21,32],[2,11,21,34],[2,11,21,35],[2,11,21,36],[2,11,22,30],[2,11,22,31],[2,11,22,32],[2,11,22,34],[2,11,22,35],[2,11,22,36],[2,11,23,31],[2,11,23,35],[2,11,29,34],[2,12,17,32],[2,12,18,32],[2,12,20,32],[2,12,21,32],[2,12,22,32],[2,15,17,30],[2,15,17,31],[2,15,17,34],[2,15,17,35],[2,15,17,36],[2,15,18,30],[2,15,18,31],[2,15,18,34],[2,15,18,35],[2,15,18,36],[2,15,20,31],[2,15,21,30],[2,15,21,31],[2,15,21,34],[2,15,21,35],[2,15,21,36],[2,15,22,30],[2,15,22,31],[2,15,22,34],[2,15,22,35],[2,15,22,36],[2,15,23,31],[2,15,23,35],[2,15,29,34],[2,16,17,30],[2,16,17,31],[2,16,17,34],[2,16,17,35],[2,16,17,36],[2,16,18,30],[2,16